### J6.3 — Request collection
### VS Code (REST Client / Humao extension), JetBrains Rider and Visual Studio 2022+ run this file directly.
### Start the app first (from the WebApp folder):  dotnet run -- J6.3
###   Variants:  dotnet run -- J6.3 --environment Development
###              Smtp__Password=s3cret dotnet run -- J6.3 --require-password
###              dotnet run -- J6.3 --Demo:Message=hello --Smtp:Port=2525

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Index of the endpoints
GET {{host}}/

### 2) The same key from five sources (isolated builder): which one wins? The LAST one.
GET {{host}}/priority

### 3) The REAL configuration of this host: providers in registration order + the provider that wins for Demo:Message
###    Try it with:  Demo__Message="from real env" dotnet run -- J6.3   and with   --Demo:Message=hello
GET {{host}}/priority/live

### 4) Hierarchical keys: ':' <-> '__', GetSection / GetValue<T> / Get<T> / GetChildren
GET {{host}}/hierarchy

### 5) Options pattern: IOptions<SmtpOptions>; the password is masked ("(not set)" until you provide Smtp__Password)
GET {{host}}/smtp
